---
// Rebuilt from the live WordPress page layout.
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Bible Boilers - clamcentral.com">
	<main class="px-4 pt-12 pb-20" style="background: #fffdf4">
		<div class="mx-auto max-w-[1080px]">
			<div>
				<img src="/images/clamcentral-logo.webp" alt="" width="600" height="121" loading="lazy" class="mx-auto h-auto w-full" style="max-width:300px" />
			</div>
			<div style="margin-top:31px">
				<h1 style="font-size:clamp(34px, 3.57vw, 50px);line-height:1.30;color:rgb(12, 17, 21);text-align:center;font-weight:700">Bible Boilers</h1>
			</div>
			<div style="margin-top:2px">
				<p style="font-size:clamp(22px, 2.29vw, 32px);line-height:1.60;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);text-align:center"><strong><strong>Bible learning activities YOU modify to fit ANY lesson!</strong></strong></p>
			</div>
			<div style="margin-top:21px">
				<img src="/images/pages/boilerimage-1.webp" alt="" width="410" height="354" loading="lazy" class="mx-auto h-auto w-full" style="max-width:329px" />
			</div>
			<div style="margin-top:21px">
				<p style="font-size:clamp(18px, 1.57vw, 22px);line-height:1.60;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);text-align:center">Very cool Bible learning activities that can be used to teach ANY Bible topic. Great to keep handy in the classroom. Add them to your favorite curriculum if you'd like extra teaching options!</p>
			</div>
			<div>
				<p style="font-size:clamp(18px, 1.57vw, 22px);line-height:1.60;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);text-align:center"><strong>Some of the activities don't require much input from you other than printing (for example Clip Art Bible Character Masks), others will have you think up questions based on your chosen Bible story (Team Squeal).</strong></p>
			</div>
			<div style="margin-top:2px">
				<p style="font-size:clamp(22px, 2.29vw, 32px);line-height:1.40;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);text-align:center"><a href="/sundayschoolchannel/bible-boilers-free.zip"><strong>Click Here to Download</strong></a></p>
			</div>
			<div style="margin-top:2px">
				<p style="font-size:clamp(22px, 2.36vw, 33px);line-height:1.60;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);text-align:center"><strong>Or check out some of these demo videos:</strong></p>
			</div>
			<div style="margin-top:2px">
				<p style="font-size:clamp(18px, 1.57vw, 22px);line-height:1.60;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);text-align:center"><strong>Click the images to watch</strong></p>
			</div>
			<div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-6 md:flex-row md:items-start md:justify-center" style="margin-top:9px">
				<div class="w-full" style="max-width:493px">
					<a href="https://youtu.be/N6gz25Ju540" class="block transition-opacity hover:opacity-90"><img src="/images/pages/bible-boilers-intro-sm.webp" alt="" width="986" height="554" loading="lazy" class="mx-auto h-auto w-full" style="max-width:493px" /></a>
				</div>
				<div class="w-full" style="max-width:493px">
					<a href="https://youtu.be/yKVKIFzX6PM" class="block transition-opacity hover:opacity-90"><img src="/images/pages/team-squeal-sm.webp" alt="" width="986" height="554" loading="lazy" class="mx-auto h-auto w-full" style="max-width:493px" /></a>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-6 md:flex-row md:items-start md:justify-center" style="margin-top:40px">
				<div class="w-full" style="max-width:493px">
					<a href="https://youtu.be/ZVK-IEMoiEw" class="block transition-opacity hover:opacity-90"><img src="/images/pages/bible-masks-sm.webp" alt="" width="986" height="554" loading="lazy" class="mx-auto h-auto w-full" style="max-width:493px" /></a>
				</div>
				<div class="w-full" style="max-width:493px">
					<a href="https://youtu.be/_FXOWbptNcI" class="block transition-opacity hover:opacity-90"><img src="/images/pages/decoderenigma-sm.webp" alt="" width="986" height="554" loading="lazy" class="mx-auto h-auto w-full" style="max-width:493px" /></a>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-6 md:flex-row md:items-start md:justify-center" style="margin-top:40px">
				<div class="w-full" style="max-width:493px">
					<a href="https://youtu.be/PEuOjw6aT2A" class="block transition-opacity hover:opacity-90"><img src="/images/pages/meaningful-motions-sm.webp" alt="" width="986" height="554" loading="lazy" class="mx-auto h-auto w-full" style="max-width:493px" /></a>
				</div>
				<div class="w-full" style="max-width:493px">
					<a href="https://youtu.be/5B4Rt3z8h-Q" class="block transition-opacity hover:opacity-90"><img src="/images/pages/bible-bingo-sm.webp" alt="" width="986" height="554" loading="lazy" class="mx-auto h-auto w-full" style="max-width:493px" /></a>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div style="margin-top:52px">
				<p style="font-size:clamp(18px, 1.57vw, 22px);line-height:1.60;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);text-align:center"><strong>All of the above Boilers are in a single folder you'll download.</strong> The folder is zipped, requiring a simple step: Right-click the folder; a window will open with a list of choices; choose "Extract all" or similar depending of your operating system. That will create a folder of the same name and that's the one you want :)</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</main>
</Layout>
